			id: "6E260819FC7E5947"
			title: "Your Next Adventure"
			description: ["Choose an adventure, an invention, or a place you want to make. The milestone routes are open from the start; specialist orders and contracts unlock as you progress.", "Already ahead? Your team's existing advancements automatically earn milestone credit when a member with that achievement is online. Collect the rewards, then go straight to the unfinished challenges.", "Milestone coins are personal rewards for each teammate. Contracts and supply orders give one shared reward set. Withdraw bank money into your inventory before buying. Your old rewards remain in the Previous Questbook group.", "Respect claims and clearly mark public entrances. PvP and pranks require consent; stop when asked. Neutral players can skip faction rivalry, and shared projects never require opposing factions."]
			icon: { id: "numismatics:cog" }
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
			size: 1.0d
			shape: "circle"
